  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BeDFfX9n\" id=\"h346b9f0-BeDFfX9n\">视频教程</h1><div data-type=\"video\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E6%8A%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81.mp4%22%2C%22size%22%3A22087740%2C%22id%22%3A%22RuUtH%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22percent%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Flf3-openapi.byteadverts.com%2Fobj%2Fopen-api-file-public%2F4c6a3a1bf8ce5c1b9f3537d78505163a%22%2C%22naturalWidth%22%3A1920%2C%22naturalHeight%22%3A940%2C%22width%22%3A854%2C%22height%22%3A418%7D\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"qz-video-contain\"><video controls=\"\" src=\"https://lf3-openapi.byteadverts.com/obj/open-api-file-public/4c6a3a1bf8ce5c1b9f3537d78505163a\" webkit-playsinline=\"webkit-playsinline\" playsinline=\"playsinline\" style=\"outline:none;\" widht=\"854\" height=\"418\"></video></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-aCvZTc05\" id=\"h346b9f0-LhVCA0WA\">使用场景</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-JhubRdmb\">日常工作中本身有大量的对内，对客的报告发送场景，通过一个定制脚本可以实现将需要观测的数据</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-yiOcDas6\">一键汇总和发送到客户群或者内部群中，无需人工汇总</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ksNt8NNb\" id=\"h346b9f0-oCnP0gWk\">解决思路</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-UYgZalqZ\">通过创建一个定时的脚本，定时拉取代理商账户下某一些指定账户的报表数据，汇总完毕后向企业IM群（如飞书群或企业微信）发送通知</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-naimL17A\">示例代码实现的为，一批adv推送一个飞书卡片，并且最后给出汇总数据。故需要配置： 广告账户 -飞书机器人 的关系，如：</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-id=\"t61fe7cd-PFASJSkj\" data-custom=\"false\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-UEUeIIQf\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0bb105d-NEQ2d5CS\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0bb105d-5FmIX2ND\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0bb105d-laVTWfgi\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-mk0Th182\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-i3FaJDCW\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-4VoRCK0P\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Jr9Pscm7\">广告账户配置</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-Smol3W0W\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-en2vIbqz\">webhook机器人配置</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t00cbcc2-jcjELeUf\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-G4kTcHY8\">推送结果</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-15WCkk0d\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-ghQPYXej\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sFKmWmi2\">广告账户A、广告账户B</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-PiBjZaOj\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TkZCtlpM\">机器人A（在客户甲的群）</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-EUXST0KG\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Pg7diWL8\">将广告账户A、B的数据推送到客户甲的群</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-2YSjWeKX\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-GDQTDdo6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FD3bmyB2\">广告账户C</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-QMH8kXpb\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xLgS47YU\">机器人B（在客户乙的群）</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-UmddGfBJ\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6lW5DYcx\">将广告账户C的数据推送到客户乙的群</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-SI2XmqFh\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-BgO7NUI2\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8gIQhMgV\">广告账户D</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-7O3LbBOW\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Of0TmZnb\">机器人C（在内部某小组的群）</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t5bc59a3-iEkOf1U1\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DmdavALi\">将广告账户D的数据推送到内部某小组的群</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22601px%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E6%9A%82%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%8D%83%E5%B7%9D%2F%E6%98%9F%E5%9B%BE%2F%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E6%8E%A8%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%2C%E4%BB%85%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8FAD%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%5Cn%20*%2